>> >>>> [1] https://lore.kernel.org/all/20260825-const_as-v1-1-1ce712225fe2@nvidia.com/
>> >>>
>> >>> ... but I agree it would be nice to be able to use this in const
>> >>> context. And there is an overlap with `const_as!` that becomes more
